---
// Cootie-catcher flap BR — bottom-right triangle. See COOTIE-SPEC.md.
// Split your base triangle into two sub-triangles along the crease from
// apex (50,50) to base midpoint (75,66.15). Darkest flap: mostly --dark,
// one --mid. Do NOT change span classes, --cc-delay, or viewBox.
---
<span class="cc-flap cc-flap--br" style="--cc-delay: 0.31s" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg class="cc-flap-svg" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">
    <polygon class="cc-paper cc-paper--dark" points="50,50 100,50 75,66.15" />
    <polygon class="cc-paper" points="50,50 75,66.15 50,82.3" />
  </svg>
</span>
